CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltYoshiIntro::
	.string "My POKéMON and I are bound\n"
	.string "together by friendship.\p"
	.string "Our bond will never be broken!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltYoshiDefeat::
	.string "This isn’t real!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltYoshi::
	.string "You seem to have a strong bond with\n"
	.string "your POKéMON too!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltLaoIntro::
	.string "We martial artists fear nothing!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltLaoDefeat::
	.string "That’s shocking!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltLao::
	.string "Fighting POKéMON are afraid of\n"
	.string "psychics...$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltNobIntro::
	.string "Words are useless.\n"
	.string "Let your fists do the talking"
CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltNobDefeat::
	.string "...$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltNob::
	.string "I lost!\n"
	.string "I’m speechless!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltLungIntro::
	.string "My raging fists will shatter your\n"
	.string "POKéMON!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltLungDefeat::
	.string "I got shattered!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BlackBeltLung::
	.string "My POKéMON lost...\n"
	.string "My pride is shattered...$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BaldingMan_1::
	.string "WAHAHAH!\p"
	.string "So you’ve come this far!\p"
	.string "Let me tell you, I’m tough!\p"
	.string "My POKéMON will crush stones and\n"
	.string "shatter bones!\p"
	.string "Watch this!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BaldingMan_2::
	.string "CHUCK: Urggh!\n"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Oooarrgh!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BaldingManIntro::
	.string "There! Scared now, are you?\p"
	.string "What?\n"
	.string "It has nothing to do with\l"
	.string "POKéMON?\l"
	.string "That’s true!\p"
	.string "Come on. We shall do battle!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BaldingManDefeat::
	.string "Wha? Huh?\n"
	.string "I lost?\p"
	.string "How about that!\n"
	.string "You’re worthy of STORMBADGE!\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the STORMBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BaldingMan_3::
	.string "WAHAHAH! I enjoyed battling you!\p"
	.string "But a loss is a loss!\p"
	.string "From now on, I’m going to train 24\n"
	.string "hours a day!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BaldingMan_4::
	.string "STORMBADGE makes all POKéMON up to\n"
	.string "L70 obey, even traded ones.\p"
	.string "It also lets your POKéMON use FLY\n"
	.string "when you’re not in a battle.\p"
	.string "Here, take this too!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_BaldingMan_5::
	.string "That is DYNAMICPUNCH.\p"
	.string "It doesn’t always hit, but when it\n"
	.string "does, it causes confusion!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_PushableBoulder4::
	.string "Boulders may now be moved!$"

CianwoodCity_Interior7_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "CIANWOOD CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: CHUCK\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:$"

